Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.75,0:00:17.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those who ceaselessly hone the art\Nof killing are known as masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.01,0:00:22.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These lethal abilities, dutifully\Npassed down through many generations,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have become what are\Ncalled modified bloodlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.83,0:00:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the story of one such master,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.93,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hikaru Gero of the Poison Clan\Nand his greatest challenge yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.97,0:00:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.23,0:00:57.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, mama, lots of time?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.79,0:01:04.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fun, fun, fun, you're\Nso cool, no, ba ba ba!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.13,0:01:31.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have that tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.53,0:01:32.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.47,0:01:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, kilogram.\NWould you who are here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.23,0:01:41.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hum 무릎?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.31,0:01:45.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Above you doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:51.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.25,0:01:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill or kiss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.43,0:01:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.89,0:01:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:57.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't kill. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.45,0:01:59.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill, I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.77,0:02:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't kill. I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.61,0:02:15.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just tell me one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.29,0:02:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a first-class boating license.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.16,0:02:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rich middle-aged guys\Nlove being on the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.53,0:02:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a qualification collector.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.57,0:02:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm IT certified, a secretary, a sommelier,\Na color designer, a drone operator.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.01,0:02:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a cosmetician.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.31,0:02:31.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are the best in the business.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.45,0:02:34.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Kimmy's\Ndoing all right for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.89,0:02:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we still don't know how\Nto get the thing off her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:40.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if I need to break\Nout the truth serum,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make the\NBeastmasters tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.49,0:02:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.61,0:02:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the lift out here,\Nbut this is where we say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.61,0:02:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've fulfilled your end of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.29,0:02:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hitman hunter isn't\Na threat to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.07,0:02:55.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that's left is for me to\Nface the head of the family on my
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.91,0:02:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,own and figure out a way to\Nconvince him to grant me my freedom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.43,0:03:02.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In short, I don't need\Nyou three any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.73,0:03:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama, I know you're trying\Nto keep us out of danger, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you going to make me\Nspell it out for you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.75,0:03:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No question, this is 100 % a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.55,0:03:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're Hikaru Gero from\Nthe Five Great Families!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.39,0:03:17.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're out for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.61,0:03:18.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.23,0:03:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.29,0:03:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't have to\Nrisk your life for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to risk it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.41,0:03:27.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a voice inside telling me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.07,0:03:32.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I walk out on you now in your time\Nof need, I'll never make anyone happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.23,0:03:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just as long as I get to clean\Nup the Beast Clan, I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the boat right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.55,0:03:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I need you to wait at the\Nharbor until I give you a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.17,0:03:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't in good conscience ask you\Nto come along to where we're going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.77,0:04:03.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be prepping for our next matchmaking\Nstrategy, so you'd better come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.33,0:04:05.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.24,0:04:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm thinking that the Beast\NClan's using Arashiyama
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:10.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,as bait to take out Pichi\Nand me at the same time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.81,0:04:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Nbeen hunting them down,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.09,0:04:15.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I don't know what\NI did to piss them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.11,0:04:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's possible that they\Nthink of me as a business rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.49,0:04:32.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First a squid, now an eagle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.41,0:04:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this an ambush?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.77,0:04:35.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama comes first!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:42.55,0:04:44.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0\shad0\fscx90\fs65\c&H8B85F2&\pos(468,-6)}Toxin: Step Up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.95,0:04:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toxin, step up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.11,0:05:02.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ultra simple how to chop\Nup squid even if you're
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\fscx90\bord3\shad0\3c&H6E5241&\c&H3BCED7&\pos(187.71,57.29)\frz20.97}Ultra simple!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\bord2.5\shad2\fs30\c&H744F44&\3c&HF6E7E0&\4c&H442822&\pos(384,101)}Anyone can prep\Na squid like this!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:00.17,0:05:03.34,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\b1\bord1.5\shad2\fs18\c&H694741&\3c&HE5D3CD&\4c&H442822&\pos(232,248)}Even a giant squid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.31,0:05:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out of your desk, um?\NYeah, real sorry. I'm gonna
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.49,0:05:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have to cook you up now
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.79,0:05:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a surprise who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.25,0:05:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would have guessed poison\Nmasters can walk on water?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.23,0:05:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step one, remove the entrails\Nfrom the body of the squid.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:21.44,0:05:24.07,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs28\c&H455354&\pos(426.5,161)}Removing the entrails\Nfrom the body\Nof the squid!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:24.07,0:05:29.78,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\an8\fscx90\fs14\c&H455354&\3c&HE6ECEF&\pos(470,60)}Removing the entrails\Nfrom the body of the squid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.27,0:05:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Start by placing your squid on a cutting\Nboard, then remove the tentacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that those pesky things\Nare out of the way, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take out the guts and then...
Dialogue: 1,0:05:38.17,0:05:40.17,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\fscx90\fs28\c&H455354&\pos(418,129)}Removing\Nthe squid's ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.13,0:05:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step two, removing the squid's ink.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.17,0:05:45.92,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord1.5\shad0\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\an8\fscx90\fs14\c&H455354&\3c&HE6ECEF&\pos(480,58)}Removing\Nthe squid's ink!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:42.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slip the body open vertically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.79,0:05:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After locating the ink sack,\Ngrab it and pull it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.43,0:05:52.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lastly, cut that mollusk\Ninto bite-sized pieces!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.91,0:05:54.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.07,0:05:56.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what Gero was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:06:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost scary how good\Nthis guy is with a knife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.77,0:06:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.97,0:06:07.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the café serves squid pasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.57,0:06:11.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like I'm first up to bat!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.33,0:06:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No surprise seeing I'm\Nthe world's fastest man!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.63,0:06:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The living legend, Kota Hanezawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.75,0:06:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way this guy is a beastmaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.21,0:06:22.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing he's a birdmaster\Nfrom a branch family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.19,0:06:24.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A subcontractor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.91,0:06:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.97,0:06:27.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.33,0:06:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why'd you lure us out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.21,0:06:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want us dead for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.73,0:06:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.64,0:06:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hell if I know. Figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he did, he wouldn't tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.53,0:06:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.44,0:06:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,taking you down will make me so stinking\Nrich I'll be set for the rest of my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.91,0:06:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm under a fancy-pants NDA,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.65,0:06:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but strictly between you and\Nme, I'll make tens of billions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.89,0:06:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why involve her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I was told if I nabbed the broad\Nfrom you first, the job would be easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.57,0:07:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not thrilled with kidnapping, but I\Ncan't go and let my feelings get in the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't believe this, but deep down,\NI've actually got a heart of gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've only gone against my core\Nbeliefs one time in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.73,0:07:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a snowy night, which\Nwas unusual for March.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.93,0:07:13.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were in the middle of practice when the
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crane I had formed a\Nlast-minute battery with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.23,0:07:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's monologuing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.73,0:07:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luckily, this badass swooped\Nin and took their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:24.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do I remove the Bonda Constrictor?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd love to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:29.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just trying to find\Nout is a serious crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.07,0:07:30.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.77,0:07:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You ready, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.43,0:07:35.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time for birch ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take the field!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.31,0:07:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdsball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.43,0:07:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is he so fast?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.55,0:07:54.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His branch must be close\Nto the main family!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.29,0:08:00.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be a chicken or\Nyou're about to be kicking!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.71,0:08:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can face him head-to-head on my\Nown terms, this game's in the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:08.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Making enemies with the poison gland\Nis stupid, but the money's too good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.89,0:08:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be from one of\Nthe five great families,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.47,0:08:12.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's not like they're the top five
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,families when it comes\Nto a straight-up fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.47,0:08:19.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need is to hit this out of\Nthe park and my life turns around.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.35,0:08:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I finish this job, I'm flying\Nstraight to America, home of baseball,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.01,0:08:26.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and breaking free of the rule books.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.49,0:08:28.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait till they get a load of Birdsball!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\fnImpact\blur0.3\bord6\shad0\fs100\pos(320,98)\c&H090097&\3c&H53FFFB&}Birdsball
Dialogue: 2,0:08:27.86,0:08:30.30,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\fnImpact\blur0.3\bord2\shad0\fs100\pos(320,98)\c&H090097&\3c&H8ABCE6&}Birdsball
Dialogue: 1,0:08:33.17,0:08:37.93,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\an8\fs60\b1\alpha&H50&\blur0.3\c&H0F377D&\pos(324,22.66)}Fish egg monitor
Dialogue: 2,0:08:33.17,0:08:37.93,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\an8\fs60\b1\blur0.3\c&HBDE8FB&}Fish egg monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.83,0:08:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How absolutely delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.27,0:08:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gato blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.67,0:08:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a poor matchup for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.49,0:08:51.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Poison Master might\Nfall to the Bird Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.27,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong, Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.75,0:08:56.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that Birdbrain\Nwho's in over his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.13,0:08:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, my heart's racing in anticipation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.65,0:09:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's obvious, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.67,0:09:05.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason the\NPoison Clan has managed to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.21,0:09:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,survive this long is thanks\Nto traps and foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.97,0:09:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course he has something planned!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:15.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His venomous fangs gnaw away at you, and\Nby the time you realize what's happening,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.19,0:09:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.43,0:09:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so worked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.03,0:09:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can barely contain myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.33,0:09:28.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Poison Master Hikaru Gero,\Nlet's see those tricks of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.65,0:09:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Entertain me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.77,0:09:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.83,0:09:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm the winner,\Nso chicken's for dinner!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.09,0:09:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bird!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:36.34,0:09:38.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Birdsball Modified Bloodline++
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.00,0:09:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bird's ball, winning shot!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:38.29,0:09:38.88,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\an8\alpha&H15&\fnArial Black\b1\blur0.3\bord3\shad0\fscx90\fs30\fsp3\c&H8B85F2&\4c&H817DBA&\pos(320,138)\3c&H190C69&}Increment
Dialogue: 1,0:09:39.01,0:09:41.47,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\an8\alpha&H35&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&HF4E1FC&\3c&HF5E5F3&}Fowl Stadium Farewell
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.31,0:09:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Foul stadium farewell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.15,0:09:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place for you\Nto hide out in the open!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoke screen?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.73,0:09:55.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, the scent tells me it's\None of his other tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.31,0:09:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison gas!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.35,0:09:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's trying to buy himself\Ntime to set up a trap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad for him we're on the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.71,0:10:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sea breeze ought\Nto clear this up soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:08.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just to be absolutely sure,\NBirdbrain: Reverse Swing!
Dialogue: 1,0:10:06.08,0:10:09.21,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.3\shad1\fscx90\fs60\c&H8B85F2&\pos(320,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Birdsball: {\alpha&HFF&\t(1630,1631,\alpha&H15&)}Reverse Swing
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Swing Avian Iron. Oh he\Nsucked me? Where's the trap?
Dialogue: 1,0:10:10.12,0:10:10.67,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur0.3\bord0.4\shad1\fscx90\fs120\c&H8B85F2&\pos(290,-2)\4c&H817DBA&}Avian {\alpha&HFF&\t(255,256,\alpha&H15&)}Iron
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.65,0:10:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That moron doesn't matter if you are\Nthe fastest guy around birdmaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You won't get very far\Nagainst skies who don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.41,0:10:28.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,play fair the whole point\Nof a trap is to catch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You off guard that's\Nwhat makes them such an
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,effective technique showing\Nyou his hand was the
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\pos(215,220)\bord2.5\shad0\fs28\blur0.5\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H261C32&\3c&H261C32&}Puff\NPuff
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial Black\pos(215,220)\bord0\shad0\fs28\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H9561B0&}Puff\NPuff
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord1.2\shad0\fs25\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&\pos(343.33,208.67)}Extra
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord0\shad0\fs25\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&HD0C0C6&\pos(343.33,208.67)}Extra
Dialogue: 1,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord1.2\shad0\fs20\blur2\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&HC9BCC0&\pos(366,207)\3c&HC9BCC0&}smoke!
Dialogue: 2,0:10:33.97,0:10:37.84,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnImpact\an8\bord0\shad0\fs20\blur0.3\frz90\t(1100,2000,\blur3)\c&H121010&\pos(366,207)}smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.63,0:10:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real trap psyching him\Nout with scented smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.77,0:10:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and straining his resources\Nwas easy i just had to
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.77,0:10:43.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait for the right opening\Nwith some help from
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.51,0:10:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,toxin step up i launched\Nmyself and grounded him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.83,0:10:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen i've still got questions for you\Nyou want to know where the beast master is?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.91,0:10:55.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Head up the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.37,0:10:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You do realize you're not gonna make\Nit all the way to the top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.17,0:11:07.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How many enemies are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.71,0:11:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another trick! Nice try!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.51,0:11:10.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some things are secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.89,0:11:14.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like how the clan mobilized all\Nthe major and minor branches.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.25,0:11:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in terms of threats, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.37,0:11:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can't help himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.28,0:11:19.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he wants to\Nspill all their secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.27,0:11:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to get a Bonda Constrictor off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's never gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.41,0:11:26.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I did hear a rumor about\Nthis one time the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.95,0:11:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, testing,\Ntesting. Is this thing on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.17,0:11:36.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, Hikaru Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.25,0:11:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Beastmaster Toshiro Dogo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.89,0:11:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Dogo Animal Kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.77,0:11:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the king of this here rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:48.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we're getting to know each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how about clearing up these\Nstories I keep hearing about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.35,0:11:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word is the future head of the Gero family\Nkeeps taking jobs that don't pay squat.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:52.66,0:11:56.54,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\bord0\shad0\b1\fs9\blur0.3\c&HABAAAD&\frz4.615\pos(271,64.5)}Hikaru Gero
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.69,0:11:58.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Changing your line of work, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.55,0:11:59.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.81,0:12:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am a bachelor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.61,0:12:04.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking for a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.65,0:12:08.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And as for the jobs, I'm helping\Npeople so I can meet women.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.49,0:12:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, I used that girl as bait, but\NI couldn't figure out why it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, the future heir of the Poison\NClan reeled in by some useless chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.19,0:12:25.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mystery solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.65,0:12:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're considering marrying her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.39,0:12:29.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A word to the wise.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.71,0:12:30.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.89,0:12:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Poison Clan has spent\Ncenturies refining their bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.31,0:12:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an SSR work of art.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:39.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd be tanking the whole industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy like you with\Nmoney and power shouldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.07,0:12:44.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be hurting to score\Nchicks with good blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.95,0:12:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lucky for her, she's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.83,0:12:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So she doesn't have to\Nlisten to your crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.57,0:12:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this one's smaller.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A spear?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.75,0:13:11.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of marriage, don't Bird and\NSpearmaster make the perfect duo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.33,0:13:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bro, never forget that he who\Nholds the blood holds the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:20.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the dawn of a new era, so I certainly\Nhope you're on the edge of your seat.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:22.07,0:13:24.05,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\bord0\shad0\blur0.3\fs26\fscx85\b1\c&H070707&)\pos(316,262)}The Animal {\alpha&HFF&\t(120,121,\alpha&H00&)}Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:13:24.55,0:13:28.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an1\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs32\pos(38,180)\c&H3A6CA9&\3c&H22364A&}Spear Master\NNagihiko Kushima
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.29,0:13:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spear Master Nagihiko\NKushima, deceased at age 72.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:27.20,0:13:28.95,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an8\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs32\c&H404796&\3c&H383945&\pos(505.33,228.67)}Aged 72 \Nat time of death
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.95,0:13:32.33,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an1\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs32\c&H437C75&\3c&H3A403F&\pos(88,278)}Kill count:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.61,0:13:31.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kill count, 887.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:29.70,0:13:32.33,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an1\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs32\c&H437C75&\3c&H3A403F&\pos(535,168)}people
Dialogue: 1,0:13:30.57,0:13:32.33,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an8\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs46\c&H733972&\3c&H391A3D&\pos(320,10)}(men and women of all ages)
Dialogue: 1,0:13:32.33,0:13:34.08,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an7\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs42\c&H356665&\3c&H2E363B&\pos(50,236)}The secret {\alpha&HFF&\t(625,626,\alpha&H00&)}of his arts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His specialty lies in\Nthe blood of his clan,
Dialogue: 1,0:13:34.08,0:13:37.19,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an7\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs38\c&H2B6684&\3c&H2A2E30&\pos(17,79)}lies in the blood of his clan,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.29,0:13:37.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which dedicated everything to the spear.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.83,0:13:37.19,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an3\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs34\c&H2B6684&\3c&H2A2E30&\pos(622,288)}which devoted all they had to
Dialogue: 1,0:13:37.33,0:13:38.06,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an7\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs38\c&H7FB8D7&\3c&H2A2E30&\pos(391.33,230.67)}the spear
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.77,0:13:43.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could unleash 88 silent\Nthrusts in only one second flat.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.33,0:13:42.57,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an9\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs58\c&H881671&\3c&H35242D&\pos(614,22)}strikes/second
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.33,0:13:42.57,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an9\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs58\c&HE5E177&\3c&H483D43&\pos(614,22)\clip(242,48.66,620.67,62.67)}strikes/second
Dialogue: 1,0:13:43.21,0:13:43.78,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\an7\bord2\shad0\b1\fscx90\blur4\fs38\c&H275F6F&\3c&H2A2E30&\pos(402,175)}Thrusts
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This power is blowing my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.97,0:13:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This rules!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:57.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made the right move pledging\Nloyalty to the Beast Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm taking Birds Ball to the\Nnext level as Bird Spearmaster!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:59.39,0:14:01.50,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord1\shad1\fsp10\t(0,130,\fsp1)\fscx90\fs65\c&H776CF0&\3c&H4166D0&\pos(326.67,160.67)\4c&H12127B&}Bird-Spear Master
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.51,0:14:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's using another master's abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.97,0:14:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:09.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless it has something to do\Nwith the lead Peachy's following.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rumor is they're planning something major.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.33,0:14:15.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something dangerous that'll\Nkill a whole lot of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.99,0:14:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're on the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.49,0:14:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bird spear's got all the\Nspeed I could ever need.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.29,0:14:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No stealing bases for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.95,0:14:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got the field covered\Nwith my avian alloy bat!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:30.97,0:14:34.16,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H15&\fnImpact\b1\blur3\bord2\shad0\fscx90\fs85\c&HBAAAFF&\3c&H6C55BD&\pos(256,144)\frz22.94}Avian Alloy Bat
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.05,0:14:33.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's called cross-sanguination, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.47,0:14:38.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I've mixed blood from different Clan\Nto create an entirely new breed of Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.23,0:14:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in an age of\Nall-you-can-eat possibilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's the fun in mastering one\Nability when you can master them all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.41,0:14:47.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, what's your move, Gero?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another sneak attack\Nwon't get you out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.67,0:14:51.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come here, Byakko!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.99,0:14:54.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to miss out on the show!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:57.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, off to collect\Nanother sample for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.91,0:14:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about rotten timing, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.67,0:15:05.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,PG really hurt himself\Ntrying to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.75,0:15:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never thought the sea\Nrescue training I picked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.85,0:15:10.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,up to impress rich surfers would save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.17,0:15:14.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somehow we made it past the octopus\Nbombs that magically appeared,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the currents tossed us on the\Nopposite side of the island from Gero.
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.33,0:15:19.29,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(450,0)\b1\fs16\an8\bord1.2\shad0\pos(343,204)\c&H443792&\3c&H262550&}Animal Kingdom
Dialogue: 1,0:15:16.72,0:15:19.29,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\b1\bord3\shad0\fs18\pos(88,29)}Probably around here
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.35,0:15:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did I go from an elegant marriage\Nswindler to a hopeless castaway?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.43,0:15:29.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, giant bear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.07,0:15:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Magnificent!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your form is gorgeous!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.17,0:15:58.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I just noticed you're\Na black belt! Impressive!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:01.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for showing us your epic moves!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.61,0:16:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, we'd better get going!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me your blood!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.19,0:16:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it wouldn't be that easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.33,0:16:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Ca-caw!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.47,0:16:15.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No more extra innings for you, ghetto!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.03,0:16:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll knock it out of the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.75,0:16:19.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes the swat song!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A walk-off grand slam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.73,0:16:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birds of a feather are supposed to stick
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.91,0:16:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together my teammates\Nwhiffed on me what did he do
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.39,0:16:34.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't underestimate a\NPoison Master. Funny, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.87,0:16:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't even notice when\NI pulled another one of
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.83,0:16:40.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My so-called cheap tricks no don't tell me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he let us peck him on\Npurpose his blood is mixed
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.59,0:16:47.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with Something I injected\Na muscle relaxant I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.25,0:16:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resistant to it with\Nyour friends not so much
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.35,0:16:55.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.43,0:16:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not losing to unsportsmanlike conduct!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.11,0:16:59.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're up, my all-stars!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.69,0:17:00.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spurts strike him out!
Dialogue: 1,0:17:06.23,0:17:08.52,Default,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,0)\fnGeorgia\b1\blur0.3\bord0\xshad-3\yshad3\4a&H50&\fs60\c&H2B00A4&\4c&HADB0C5&\frz33.89\pos(108,120)}Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.33,0:17:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.33,0:17:15.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Hikaru Gero, I've got to\Nhave a taste of your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.27,0:17:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soon, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.91,0:17:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.82,0:17:22.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Arashiyama.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.74,0:17:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say something. You good?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.31,0:17:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.39,0:17:34.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your bleeding will stop\Nif you remain still.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, to answer your question,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're just a baseball enthusiast\Nwho is brainwashed by the bees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.67,0:17:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdsball is the avian sport that\Ntranscends the perfection of baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:47.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right my teammates?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.43,0:17:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a shutout. Gero.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.15,0:17:55.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next time I'm gonna whoop\Nyou fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.59,0:17:57.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I challenge you to a real game.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.71,0:17:59.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be a rematch
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.93,0:18:08.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's such a shame crossing\Nthe nation smashes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.19,0:18:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,together different bloodlines\Nbut once activated,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they each fight for\Ndominance within the host.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.35,0:18:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end result is death.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.23,0:18:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Branch families are nothing but\Nplaythings for the main clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:26.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodo was actually a guinea pig, and\NHamster Girl is only holding you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.19,0:18:29.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said you wanted that\NBonda constrictor off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:30.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a hint.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.51,0:18:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The master key is my blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.39,0:18:38.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you'd better head over to my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.83,0:18:42.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole clan's here waiting\Nto get this party started!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.61,0:18:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdbrain pecked out just enough blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.23,0:18:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for now, but I won't be satisfied\Nuntil I've drained every last drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:52.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poison master.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.95,0:18:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I ever wanted was for Bird's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.47,0:19:02.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ball to make the big leagues.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.01,0:19:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.09,0:19:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm feeling better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.17,0:19:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Piichi, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:49.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master Toshiro, this is Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.25,0:19:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I collected this sample\Nwithout difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.11,0:19:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew this would work, but it's\Ngoing smoother than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.13,0:20:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in a better mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.41,0:20:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here you go, Byakko.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.61,0:20:04.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made this one just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.25,0:20:06.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not while I'm on duty. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.65,0:20:08.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think you're too\Ngood to play with my toy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:11.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, whatever, I don't really care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.89,0:20:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Operation Bloodline Collection is\Ncomplete, or blowpleat for short.
