Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The issue with cross-sanguination is your
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.45,0:20:21.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,body rejects the new blood\Nso hard it wrecks you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the Gator family's blood\Nhas adapted to so many toxins?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.79,0:20:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It neutralizes any adverse reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.15,0:20:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,meaning the host won't\Ndrop dead like that dodo.
